{"speciesId":543,"names":{"fr":"Venipatte","es":"Venipede","en":"Venipede","ja":"フシデ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa morsure est très venimeuse. Elle paralyse même les grands Pokémon Oiseaux, ses prédateurs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its bite injects a potent poison, enough to paralyze large bird Pokémon that try to prey on it."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il sonde les alentours avec les antennes sur sa tête et sa queue. Il est extrêmement brutal."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It discovers what is going on around it by using the feelers on its head and tail. It is brutally aggressive."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its prey’s location and state."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its prey’s location and state."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il sonde les alentours avec les antennes sur sa tête et sa queue. Il est extrêmement brutal."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Percibe su entorno con su sentido del tacto, residente en su cabeza y cola. Su carácter es violento por naturaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It discovers what is going on around it by using the feelers on its head and tail. It is brutally aggressive."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭と 尻尾の 触角で まわりの 様子を 探る。 非常に 凶暴な 性格。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa morsure est très venimeuse. Elle paralyse même les grands Pokémon Oiseaux, ses prédateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Inocula un poderoso veneno al morder. Hasta sus enemigos acérrimos, los Pokémon pájaro, se quedan inmóviles."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its bite injects a potent poison, enough to paralyze large bird Pokémon that try to prey on it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"かみついて 猛毒を 与える。